                "description": "Paddle Lever With Stepped Rose Fusion AF-B1 - This traditional styled Paddle Door Lever with Stepped Rose is available in 5 finishes. It is made out of solid brass and will fit all standard door preparations. An excellent quality lever, it is backed by a lifetime warranty.",
